Package: pkident
Title: Structural and Practical Identifiability for Pharmacokinetic and Pharmacodynamic Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daiki", "Kumakura", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "55353329+DaikiKumakura@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Determines which parameters of pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic
    ordinary differential equation models can be identified from a given dosing
    and observation design, and which added measurement would make the others
    identifiable. Decisions are local and are stated as such.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/DaikiKumakura/pkident
BugReports: https://github.com/DaikiKumakura/pkident/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
